<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Archet - Fine Bows</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header>
    <div class="logo">
      <!-- 頂部防不破圖超級 Logo 組合 -->
      <div style="display: inline-block; text-align: left;">
        <!-- 精準短弧線（涵蓋至 h 字母上） -->
        <svg width="85" height="16" viewBox="0 0 85 16" style="display: block; margin-left: 2px; margin-bottom: -2px;">
          <path d="M 5 14 Q 42 2 80 14" stroke="#C58B58" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
        <!-- 絕對不會消失的 HTML 白字 -->
        <div style="font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF !important; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Archet</div>
        <!-- 副標題 -->
        <div style="font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7px; font-weight: 400; color: #A1A1A6 !important; letter-spacing: 3px; margin-top: 3px;">FINE BOWS</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
      <a href="#craftsman">CRAFTSMAN</a>
      <a href="#awards">AWARDS</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
  <main>
    <!-- CRAFTSMAN SECTION -->
    <section id="craftsman">
      <div class="craftsman-container">
        <div class="craftsman-image">
          <img src="images/IMG_6020.jpeg" alt="製弓大師形象照" style="width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <img src="images/IMG_6019.jpeg" alt="製弓大師形象照" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
        </div>
        
        <div class="craftsman-text">
          <h3>[ 主人翁 / 創辦人姓名 ]</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px;">
            這裡預留給你填寫製弓師或創辦人的故事。您可以介紹他的背景、對聲音的執著，以及如何創立 Archet 品牌。
          </p>
          <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            「每一把弓都是演奏者手臂的延伸，我們的任務就是讓這道弧線達到絕對的精準。」
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AWARDS SECTION -->
    <section id="awards" style="background: #161616;">
      <h2 class="section-title">RECOGNITION</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Awards & Achievements</p>

      <div class="awards-grid">
        <div class="award-item">
          <div class="award-year">2025</div>
          <div class="award-title">[ 獲獎名稱 / 賽事名稱 ]</div>
          <div class="award-desc">預留位置：描述獲得的獎項，例如國際製弓大賽金獎或音色創新獎。</div>
        </div>

        <div class="award-item">
          <div class="award-year">2024</div>
          <div class="award-title">[ 獲獎名稱 / 賽事名稱 ]</div>
          <div class="award-desc">預留位置：描述獲得的獎項或展覽殊榮。</div>
        </div>

        <div class="award-item">
          <div class="award-year">2023</div>
          <div class="award-title">國際賽事獲獎證書</div>
          <div class="award-desc">
            <img src="images/IMG_6018.jpeg" alt="獲獎證明" style="width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 10px;">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>
    <div class="footer-logo">
      <!-- 頁尾防不破圖超級 Logo 組合 -->
      <div style="display: inline-block; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <svg width="85" height="16" viewBox="0 0 85 16" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto -2px auto;">
          <path d="M 5 14 Q 42 2 80 14" stroke="#C58B58" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
        <div style="font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF !important; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Archet</div>
        <div style="font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7px; font-weight: 400; color: #A1A1A6 !important; letter-spacing: 3px; margin-top: 3px;">FINE BOWS</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 2px;">PRECISION IN EVERY ARC.</p>
    <p class="copyright">&copy; 2026 archetype.com. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
